LobsterAI version-scoped fix for OpenClaw v2026.8.1.
Persist receipt-preparation failures before finished events at the shared admission boundary.
Guard against concurrent owners; preserve manual force cadence and existing automatic retry policy.
No upstream commit yet: retire when the equivalent upstream fix passes these regressions.

